# Routes only the @lksnext scope to GitHub Packages. This affects publishing the three
# @lksnext/iac-conventions-* packages and installing them as external dependencies; it does
# not change where third-party dependencies of this repository resolve from (they continue
# to use npm's default registry, registry.npmjs.org).
#
# This file MUST NOT contain any credential (_authToken, username, or password). Authenticate
# separately via a securely supplied environment variable/CI secret — never commit a token
# here. See docs/release-notes/publishing.md for the required authentication mechanism.
@lksnext:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
